{"id":"n63060-1-8","stage":5,"title":"서성거리다 · 徘徊","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63060-1-8-1","ko":"아까부터 누가 대문 앞을 서성거리는 것 같아요.","zh":"从刚才开始，好像有人在大门前徘徊呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까부터","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대문","meaning":"大门","explanation":"대문：大门","readings":[{"term":"대문","audio":"/audio/ade1526c0cab5d44f2d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57955","senseId":"1","lemma":"대문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞을","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서성거리는","meaning":"徘徊，踱来踱去","explanation":"서성거리다：徘徊，踱来踱去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"서성거리다","audio":"/audio/9750463ef5355d97ee21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63060","senseId":"1","lemma":"서성거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"ade1526c0cab5d44","term":"대문","zh":"大门","audio":"/audio/ade1526c0cab5d44f2d1.mp3","entryId":"57955","definition":"主要在房子的前面，供人们进出的大的门。","pronunciation":["대ː문"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"9750463ef5355d97","term":"서성거리다","zh":"徘徊，踱来踱去","audio":"/audio/9750463ef5355d97ee21.mp3","entryId":"63060","definition":"不站在同一个地方，而是不停地在周围走来走去。","pronunciation":["서성거리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/aec5686379bfc89c572e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63060-1-8-2","ko":"내가 나가서 누군지 살펴보고 올게.","zh":"我出去看看是谁，然后回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누군지","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살펴보고","meaning":"查看，细看","explanation":"살펴보다：查看，细看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"살펴보다","audio":"/audio/b45d19cd4efc5d09e638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67895","senseId":"2","lemma":"살펴보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올게.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"b45d19cd4efc5d09","term":"살펴보다","zh":"查看，细看","audio":"/audio/b45d19cd4efc5d09e638.mp3","entryId":"67895","definition":"寻找或探看某物。","pronunciation":["살펴보다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c8c8c8ceda1ae17d919.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.309,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63060","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我出去看看是谁，然后回来。","从刚才开始，好像有人在大门前徘徊呢。","在山里，我遇到了和城里人不一样的那些人。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从刚才开始，好像有人在大门前徘徊呢。","在山里，我遇到了和城里人不一样的那些人。","我出去看看是谁，然后回来。"],"answer":2}]}
